231   8122              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
232   8122              ; Sweep the nine requested standard PC display resolutions.
233   8122              ; Each mode uses 8-bpp indexed pixels and writes exactly its visible
234   8122              ; framebuffer size. The repeating 00h..FFh pattern exercises all 256
235   8122              ; palette indices. SPACE advances to the next resolution.
236   8122              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
